{"id":"a034f3a151f1b51f","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/799_P_1_相容逻辑.md","title":"799 P 1 相容逻辑","display":"799_P_1_相容逻辑","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"799-P_1-相容逻辑\">799 P_1 相容逻辑</h1>\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子的型别为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,\\circ A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,\\circ A,A\\wedge B,A\\vee B,A\\to B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span> 为满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cons}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{cons}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{and}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{or}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变元、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{P1}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\)</span> 定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{bot})=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{cons}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{neg}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\n\\qquad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\operatorname{cons}(\\widehat\\sigma(A)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{and}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{or}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))\n=\n\\operatorname{imp}(\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\widehat\\sigma(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{P1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{P1}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{P1}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{P1}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1}\\ \\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1}\\ \\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\qquad\nA\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-P_1-三值载体与指定值\">4. P_1 三值载体与指定值</h1>\n<p>真值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V_{P1}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf V_{P1}=\\{\\mathbf f,\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathbf f&lt;\\mathbf b&lt;\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>指定值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf D_{P1}=\\{\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf D_{P1}=\\{\\mathbf b,\\mathbf t\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>底常元解释为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot_{P1}=\\mathbf f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot_{P1}=\\mathbf f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-P_1-真值运算\">5. P_1 真值运算</h1>\n<p>否定与一致性算子为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{P1},\\circ_{P1}:\\mathsf V_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{P1},\\circ_{P1}:\\mathsf V_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\neg_{P1}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf f,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf f,\\qquad\n\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf t.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf f=\\mathbf t,\\qquad\n\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf f,\\qquad\n\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf t=\\mathbf t.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>二元联结词为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_{P1},\\vee_{P1},\\Rightarrow_{P1}:\n\\mathsf V_{P1}\\times\\mathsf V_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\wedge_{P1},\\vee_{P1},\\Rightarrow_{P1}:\n\\mathsf V_{P1}\\times\\mathsf V_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\wedge_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathsf D_{P1},\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\text{否则},\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\wedge_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a,b\\in\\mathsf D_{P1},\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;\\text{否则},\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\vee_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{P1}\\text{ 或 }b\\in\\mathsf D_{P1},\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;a=b=\\mathbf f,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\vee_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf t,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{P1}\\text{ 或 }b\\in\\mathsf D_{P1},\\\\\n\\mathbf f,&amp;a=b=\\mathbf f,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\Rightarrow_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf f,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{P1}\\text{ 且 }b=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf t,&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\Rightarrow_{P1}b=\n\\begin{cases}\n\\mathbf f,&amp;a\\in\\mathsf D_{P1}\\text{ 且 }b=\\mathbf f,\\\\\n\\mathbf t,&amp;\\text{否则}.\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>上述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{P1}\">\\(\\circ_{P1}\\)</span> 不是独立于 P1 的任意真值函数；它与公式定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\circ A:=\\neg\\neg A\\vee\\neg(A\\wedge A)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\circ A:=\\neg\\neg A\\vee\\neg(A\\wedge A)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>在本矩阵中逐值相同。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-赋值与公式值\">6. 赋值与公式值</h1>\n<p>赋值集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}=\\{v:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的扩张</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf V_{P1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{P1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=v(p),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{bot})=\\bot_{P1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{P1}\\overline v(A),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\circ_{P1}\\overline v(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\neg_{P1}\\overline v(A),\n\\qquad\n\\overline v(\\operatorname{cons}(A))=\\circ_{P1}\\overline v(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{P1}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{and}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\wedge_{P1}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{P1}\\overline v(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{or}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\vee_{P1}\\overline v(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{P1}\\overline v(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\overline v(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\overline v(A)\\Rightarrow_{P1}\\overline v(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-语义后承与证书\">7. 语义后承与证书</h1>\n<p>反例证书函数的型别及定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}:\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{P1})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{P1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)\n=\n\\{v\\in\\mathsf{Val}_{P1}:\n(\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\overline v(G)\\in\\mathsf D_{P1})\n\\text{ 且 }\n\\overline v(A)\\notin\\mathsf D_{P1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P1}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\Vdash_{P1}A\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>语义证书关系的型别及定义为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1}\\subseteq\n\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1}(\\Gamma,A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>空前提后承集合为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Valid}_{P1}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{P1}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Valid}_{P1}\n=\n\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}:\\varnothing\\Vdash_{P1}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-结构规则与证明层排除\">8. 结构规则与证明层排除</h1>\n<p>分离规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1}\n=\n\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1}\\subseteq\n(\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1})\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>代换规则关系为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1}\n=\n\\{((A),\\widehat\\sigma(A)):\nA\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\\ \\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1}\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>形式证明规则关系声明为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-整个语义形式系统\">9. 整个语义形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{P1}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1},\n\\widehat{(\\cdot)},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1},\n\\mathsf V_{P1},\n\\mathsf D_{P1},\n\\bot_{P1},\n\\neg_{P1},\n\\circ_{P1},\n\\wedge_{P1},\n\\vee_{P1},\n\\Rightarrow_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{P1},\n\\overline{(\\cdot)},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1},\n\\Vdash_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{P1}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{P1},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{P1},\n\\widehat{(\\cdot)},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,P1},\n\\mathsf V_{P1},\n\\mathsf D_{P1},\n\\bot_{P1},\n\\neg_{P1},\n\\circ_{P1},\n\\wedge_{P1},\n\\vee_{P1},\n\\Rightarrow_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Val}_{P1},\n\\overline{(\\cdot)},\n\\mathsf{Fail}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{SemCert}_{P1},\n\\Vdash_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Valid}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{MPRule}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{SubRule}_{P1},\n\\mathsf{Rule}^{\\operatorname{proof}}_{P1}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统的目标差异是 P1 的三值运算只输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf f\">\\(\\mathbf f\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf t\\)</span> 于复合式：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t\">\\(\\neg\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\\wedge\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t\">\\(\\mathbf b\\wedge\\mathbf b=\\mathbf t\\)</span>，故矛盾容忍集中在原子层，而不是把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b\">\\(\\mathbf b\\)</span> 当作 LP 的固定点。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ A\">\\(\\circ A\\)</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\neg A\\vee\\neg(A\\wedge A)\">\\(\\neg\\neg A\\vee\\neg(A\\wedge A)\\)</span> 定义并满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf f\">\\(\\circ_{P1}\\mathbf b=\\mathbf f\\)</span>。系统不含 Hilbert 公理化证明系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"799-P_1-相容逻辑","text":"799 P_1 相容逻辑","level":1},{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-P_1-三值载体与指定值","text":"4. P_1 三值载体与指定值","level":1},{"id":"5.-P_1-真值运算","text":"5. P_1 真值运算","level":1},{"id":"6.-赋值与公式值","text":"6. 赋值与公式值","level":1},{"id":"7.-语义后承与证书","text":"7. 语义后承与证书","level":1},{"id":"8.-结构规则与证明层排除","text":"8. 结构规则与证明层排除","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个语义形式系统","text":"9. 整个语义形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}:\\mathsf{Prop}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp}:\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\times\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{P1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{cons},\n\\opera